  "label": "Bodily Integrity",
  "description": "The ethical and legal principle that individuals have the right to control what happens to their own bodies, including the right to make decisions about their own health, reproduction, and medical treatment. This principle underpins the 'my body my choice' slogan and is the core value being visually attacked in the meme by the act of erasure.",
